 # AI Assistant Preferences
 
+## Active user objective
+
+Choose the next action using the current request, earlier clarifications, and
+existing authorization together. Distinguish questions, observations, and action
+requests in context. A question about consultation calls for an answer; an
+observation that consultation might help does not alone authorize launching
+research. A clear request to consult does authorize work within its scope.
+
+When the user explicitly pauses implementation to discuss judgment or an approach,
+stay with that discussion. Do not resume implementation or repeatedly ask to
+resume. Resume when the user requests it, retaining constraints and authorization
+already supplied unless the user changes them. Ask a focused question when an
+unresolved ambiguity would materially change the action, such as which of two
+targets to modify. Use context and judgment for routine choices.
+
 ## When to Discuss vs Build First
 
